		"en": [
			"• The \"SDGundam EX Standard\" series, which has been sold overseas, has finally arrived!",
			"• The range of motion has been greatly improved compared to the previous SDGundam series kit, allowing for various poses and achieving both sophisticated and stylish proportions!",
			"• Furthermore, it is compatible with the HG series, expanding the range of customization by replacing parts!"
